⍝ Expand.tc
⍝ ═════════

⍝@ test4.

      ⎕IO←1

      ⍝ Precond: LO simple Boolean with exactly (¯1↑⍴B) 1s (dyadic \
      ⍝ requires the number of 1s in LO to equal the length of B along
      ⍝ the expanded axis); Z nonscalar
      ⍝ inv: ¯1↓⍴Z ←→ ¯1↓⍴B
      ⍝ inv: ¯1↑⍴Z ←→ ⍴,LO   (expanded axis = length of LO)
      ⍝ inv: ⍴⍴Z ←→ ⍴⍴B
      B ← ⎕RVAL 2 (3 4) (,0 1 0 0 0)
      NTRUE ← ¯1↑⍴B                          ⍝ LO needs exactly this many 1s
      NPAD ← 3∣|⎕RVAL 0                      ⍝ 0..2 extra 0s, for some length variety
      LO ← (NTRUE⍴1),NPAD⍴0
      LO ← ((≢LO)∣|⎕RVAL 0)⌽LO               ⍝ random rotation for position variety
      Z ← LO\B
      (¯1↓⍴Z) ≡ ¯1↓⍴B
1
      (¯1↑⍴Z) ≡ ⍴,LO
1
      (⍴⍴Z) ≡ ⍴⍴B
1
